## Sprint 6.4 — Governance Amendment: Build-Time vs. Runtime AI ✅

**Status:** COMPLETE — Build 2026.07.22.006

**Scope:** Governance — clarified the frozen rule "AI never determines correctness, scoring, formulas, or blueprint mapping" into two temporal scopes.

**Build-time AI (audit-phase):** Actively verifies correctness, precision, difficulty, distractor quality, blueprint alignment, and CMA relevance. Non-binding; human maintains final revision authority.

**Runtime AI (future, learner-facing):** Synthesis and explanation only. Never determines correctness, scoring, formulas, or blueprint mapping.

